  "labelsNote": "The entries whose labels tools/personalize.mjs translates when the root is written in another language than its own (chromeLabelsOf, TCH #1013): the chrome (header, footer, search, 404) and every page's own headings, buttons, breadcrumb and title (the source of its <title>); the menus are translated beside them. A rule with `fields` names only those fields. Addresses, names, references and fields another rule writes (copy, blocks, rewrite, facts, identity) are left alone; an identity sentence the template has only in another language is translated with them.",
